  "scope": "Original rational market family: a supplied finite beta=0 intervention from every physical positive renewal share reaches the original beta=1/2 protection rectangle. A finite recursively specified stock cover pays nonnegative per-step extra support cost and preserves the actual original guarded history until handoff. The arrived state, without reset, satisfies the inherited perpetual nonfailure certificate after withdrawal. Zero seed, insufficient initial support and absence of a uniform pulse duration are retained. No least-cost policy, complete basin, entry mechanism, endogenous formation of the intervention, empirical threshold or new ethical axiom."
